window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A Story of Love, Loss, and Finding Strength in Family. For Hazel, Olivia, and Kadin, life has always been about leaning on one another and navigating the ups and downs of love, friendship, and family. However, as Olivia faces an unimaginable diagnosis, the bonds between them are put to the ultimate test. Hazel must learn to trust her one true love, while Kadin battles with guilt over hidden feelings she can’t let go of. Together, they face the most challenging year of their lives as they navigate the joy of new beginnings alongside the heartache of loss. </p> <p>With deep friendships, resilient love, and unbreakable family ties, the women must learn that life goes on in the wake of tragedy—but it’s never quite the same. Will the pieces of their lives be enough to carry them through? The Joy Of It All is a powerful story about the strength of relationships, the weight of grief, and the enduring hope that binds us all.</p>"; 
